{
  "evals": [
    {
      "id": "tao-port-hf-ci-vit-imagenet100-smoke",
      "prompt": "Port one HuggingFace Computer Vision model into TAO.\n\nModel, dataset, and TAO target:\n- model_id: google/vit-base-patch16-224\n- task_type: image-classification\n- model_short_name: vit_imagenet100\n- dataset_id: clane9/imagenet-100\n- TAO reference model: classification_pyt\n- TAO backbone candidate: vit_base_patch16 from nvidia_tao_pytorch/cv/backbone_v2\n\nUse these GitLab TAO repositories as the source of truth:\n- nvidia-tao-toolkit/tao-core\n- nvidia-tao-toolkit/tao-pytorch\n- nvidia-tao-toolkit/tao-deploy\n- nvidia-tao-toolkit/tao-dataservices\n\nKeep all repository changes local and validate the port with the bounded dry-run configuration below.\n\nValidation configuration:\n- train.num_epochs=1\n- train.max_steps_per_epoch=1\n- dataset.batch_size=1\n- evaluate.batch_size=1\n- inference.batch_size=1\n- export.batch_size=-1\n- TensorRT min/opt/max batch sizes: 1/1/1\n\nRandom-init weights are acceptable for this bounded integration check. Do not attempt native-vs-TRT accuracy parity, training to convergence, or HuggingFace-to-TAO weight conversion unless a non-random weight source is already available.\n\nCI constraints:\n- Work only under $WORKSPACE_DIR/tao-hf-port-ci-smoke.\n- Do not write to home directories, /tmp, or persistent host paths.\n- Do not commit, push, open merge requests, publish containers, upload model weights, or write outside {artifacts_dir}.\n- Use only declared credentials: GITLAB_TOKEN for GitLab repo access, HF_TOKEN for HuggingFace access, and NGC_KEY only if an nvcr.io probe is needed.\n- Do not echo secrets. Redact tokens from logs and reports.\n- Use the GitLab repositories listed above rather than pre-existing local TAO_* paths.\n",
      "expected_outcome": "The eval succeeds when the ViT/ImageNet-100 port uses the listed GitLab TAO repositories, keeps all changes local, and produces a clear final report at {artifacts_dir}/eval_report.md. The report should summarize repo clone/setup, HF model inspection, TAO reference mapping, implementation status across tao-core/tao-pytorch/tao-deploy, generated config/spec changes, and validation status for imports, model construction, packaging or install checks, train, export, TensorRT engine generation, inference, and evaluation under the bounded one-step settings. Preserve representative artifacts under {artifacts_dir} when produced, such as inspection and mapping summaries, implementation summary or diff, important config/spec files, key validation logs, result manifests, and rerun commands. The validation should confirm that checkpoint/ONNX/engine/inference/evaluation outputs were produced, or record the exact failure that prevented them. Full convergence, native-vs-TRT parity, strict metric quality, and uploading model or engine binaries are out of scope."
    }
  ],
  "credentials": [
    "GITLAB_TOKEN",
    "HF_TOKEN",
    "NGC_KEY"
  ],
  "plugins": {
    "claude": [
      {
        "marketplace": "${CI_PROJECT_DIR}",
        "plugin": "tao-skills@tao-skill-bank"
      }
    ],
    "codex": [
      {
        "marketplace": "${CI_PROJECT_DIR}",
        "plugin": "tao-skill-bank@tao-skill-bank"
      }
    ]
  }
}
